   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coping with Loneliness, Anxiety &amp; lack of Purpose</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our goal is to support seniors who live in homes and are over 60 years old.   Most of them struggle with health situations and are alone and do not receive visits.  The project that we are asking you to support are the activities that we provide on  regular basis.  We aim to increase the capatity to share with others their own age and learn from each other. We have aleady seen very positive results.  That is why we want to give others this opportunity and you can help.</narrative>
  </description>
